  "scope": "Execute original native credential response decorators offline.\n\nThe complete proprietary access/client response decision routines execute\nunchanged. Synthetic provider/cache and response/map interfaces supply inputs;\ncallbacks observe invalidation, stored failure and forwarding without HTTP.\n",
  "toolSha256": "717152755ca9a2e5c76518892a76bc2148abcb455669a1c686bedbea69567d09",
  "responseChainEvidence": {
